'''Hazmat''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 4]] or through trading.  

== Appearance ==
Its blade is made up of brown and black stripes with the brown stripes containing a thin crossover pattern over them. The guard is brown, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==
* Its [https://www.roblox.com/library/311358906/Toxic texture] was designed by [[ArcticMage]], and was uploaded to Roblox on October 19, 2015 under the name Toxic.
